'''Wisdom of Sea and Sky''' (Japanese: '''{{j|空と海の導き}}''' ''Guidance of Sea and Sky'') is the ninth expansion of cards in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Wisdom of Sea and Sky''' is the fourth main expansion released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. The expansion focuses heavily on [[Generation II]] and features Pokémon and characters from the [[Johto]] region; its two booster packs are themed around {{p|Ho-Oh}} and {{p|Lugia}}, the [[game mascot]]s and featured Legendary Pokémon of {{game|Gold and Silver|s}} and their remakes, {{game|HeartGold and SoulSilver|s}}.

The expansion introduces [[Baby Pokémon]] to the game, which were introduced to the [[core series]] in Generation II; these are depicted as {{TCG|Basic Pokémon}} with 30 {{TCG|HP}}, no {{TCG|Weakness}}es or {{TCG|Retreat Cost}}s, and attacks that require no {{TCG|Energy}} to use.

