== Offering rates ==
The following tables outline the offering rates for each Wisdom of Sea and Sky booster pack.

The probability of each type of pack appearing is as follows:
* Regular pack - 91.620%
* Regular pack + 1 card - 8.330%
* Rare pack - 0.050%

In regular packs with a bonus card, the card inclusion rates for the first five cards are the same as those for regular packs without a bonus card.

=== Wisdom of Sea and Sky: Ho-Oh ===
While all {{rar/TCGP|Crown}} cards can be found in regular packs, the only one that can be pulled from a rare pack is {{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Ho-Oh ex|240}}.

{{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Magby|32}} (#032), {{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Smoochum|75}} (#075), {{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Tyrogue|101}} (#101), and {{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Magby|166}} (#166) are only available as bonus cards.

